        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          A shared treadmill has to suit the tallest runner, carry the heaviest user and survive everyone’s combined hours — while staying safe around children and quiet enough for the household’s schedule.
