          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#FF5A1F]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h7"></path></svg>
          In This Guide
        </h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#short-answer" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">1. The Short Answer: Size for the Extremes, Rate for the Total</a>
          <a href="#tallest-runner" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">2. Deck Size: Buy for the Tallest Runner</a>
          <a href="#heaviest-user" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">3. Weight Capacity: Buy for the Heaviest User</a>
          <a href="#combined-hours" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">4. Motor: Rate It for Combined Daily Hours</a>
