          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Size a family treadmill for the extremes.</strong> The deck for
            the tallest runner, the capacity for the heaviest user with about 50 lb of headroom, and
            the motor for everyone's combined daily hours in continuous horsepower. Add user
            profiles and agree who maintains it.
